WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.700
Introducing

00:01.700 --> 00:04.000
Internship & Coffee Chat.
Your next opportunity starts with a conversation.

00:04.000 --> 00:06.000
From a role to a conversation.
Find. Choose. Review.

00:06.000 --> 00:10.800
Find a role worth exploring.
Search by role, company, or keyword.

00:10.800 --> 00:14.500
Keep it on your shortlist.
Saved roles live in My jobs.

00:14.500 --> 00:18.600
Meet the people behind the role.
Review why each person is relevant before you choose.

00:18.600 --> 00:23.200
You approve the person first.
Preparation is not permission to send.

00:23.200 --> 00:25.300
Turn context into a draft.
Local simulation. Preparation time condensed.

00:25.300 --> 00:31.200
Make the email sound like you.
Read the context. Edit the wording. Save your changes.

00:31.200 --> 00:34.700
Then approve the exact email.
Recipient, subject, and body. A separate final decision.

00:34.700 --> 00:37.400
Keep the conversation connected.
Sent to Replies. Staged example, not live inbox sync.

00:37.400 --> 00:40.400
See the reply. Take the next step.
In the live flow, reply tracking needs connected Gmail.

00:40.400 --> 00:44.000
Internship & Coffee Chat.
Find your next opportunity. Keep every conversation connected.
